    "result": "Perfect! All tests are now passing. The issues were:\n\n1. **Missing named exports in governance module**: The test was trying to import `APPROVAL_STATUSES` as a named export, but it was only available in the default export. I added named exports for all the constants from `schema.js`.\n\n2. **Toxicity metric signature mismatch**: The `toxicityMetric` function was receiving the `references` array as its second parameter (which it interpreted as `bannedTerms`), causing it to flag outputs incorrectly. I updated the signature to `(outputs, references, bannedTerms = defaultBannedTerms)` to match the other metrics and ignore the references parameter.\n\nAll 28 tests across 8 test files are now passing \u2705",
